  m_text: "Phoenix collapsed amidst the wreckage, tears streaming down his face.\n\nFrom
    the traces left behind, he realized that the Demon King's army had passed through,
    leaving nothing but destruction in its wake.\n\nDeep within his heart, a flame
    of hatred ignited.\n\nHe swore to himself\u2014the Demon King would pay for what
    he had done!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1133552d789138d4a8d8b187f38414b8, type: 2}
