  m_text: "One day, Phoenix left the village to go hunting.\n\nBut when he returned
    the next day, the sight before him shattered his heart.\n\nThe once-peaceful
    village was now reduced to smoldering ruins, with bodies scattered everywhere.\n\nAnd
    the most painful of all\u2014his parents and sister were gone."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
